#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_merge.rst:5
msgid "Merge cells"
msgstr "合并单元格"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_merge.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech `title block editor`_ allows merging `cells`_ from `menu bar`_,"
" `toolbar`_ and using the corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech `图框编辑器 <title block editor_>`_ 允许将 `cells <cells_>`_ 从 `菜单栏 "
"<menu bar_>`_，`工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 合并，并使用相应的键盘快捷键。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_merge.rst:10
msgid ""
"QElectroTech has no restrictions merging `cells`_, QElectroTech allows "
"merging `cells`_ from same `column`_ and/or `row`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech没有合并 `cells <cells_>`_ 的限制，QEctroTech允许从相同的 `栏 <cells_>`_ 和/或 "
"`row <column_>`_ 合并 `cells <row_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_merge.rst:14
msgid "Merge cells from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏合并单元格"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_merge.rst:16
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_merge.rst:31
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_merge.rst:45
msgid "Select the `cells`_ which should be merged."
msgstr "选择应当合并的 `单元格 <cells_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_merge.rst:17
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Merge cells** menu item to merge the selected `cells`_."
msgstr "选择 **Edit > 合并单元格** 菜单项以合并选定的 `单元格 <cells_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_merge.rst:22
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block editor, edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech图框编辑器，编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_merge.rst:26
msgid "To select more than one `cell`_, press **Ctrl** from keyboard."
msgstr "要选择一个以上的 `cell <cell_>`_，请按 **Ctrl** 从键盘中选择。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_merge.rst:29
msgid "Merge cells from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏合并单元格"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_merge.rst:32
msgid ""
"Select the icon |icon_merge| from `toolbar`_ to merge the selected `cells`_."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |icon_merge| 合并选定的 `单元格 <cells_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_merge.rst:38
msgid "icon_merge"
msgstr "图标( E)"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_merge.rst:36
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Edit**"
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 编辑** 显示"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_merge.rst:41
msgid "Merge cells using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键合并单元格"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_merge.rst:43
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_merge.rst:46
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + j`` to merge the selected `cells`_."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + j`` 合并选定的 `单元格 <cells_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_merge.rst:50
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
